sequenceDiagram
  participant T1 as Transfer A to B
  participant DB as Engine
  participant T2 as Transfer B to A
  T1->>DB: locks A
  T2->>DB: locks B
  T1->>DB: asks for B and waits
  T2->>DB: asks for A and waits
  Note over DB: cycle detected
  DB-->>T2: chosen as victim, transaction aborted
  DB-->>T1: gets B and commits
  T2->>DB: full retry with the same opId
  Note over T1,T2: with a global order (lower key first)<br/>both ask for A before B and the cycle never forms
